      "10": {
        "content": "### dnsdist frontends\nnslb VM reports as `nslb.lindleyhome.com` in Dynatrace (OneAgent). nslb-pi uses OTel.",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      "11": {
        "content": "## DNS v4 \u2014 full stack\nClients \u2192 **dnsdist** VIPs `nslb` (.120) / `nslb-pi` (.121) \u2192 BIND backends `ns0`, `ns1`, `utility01`, `utility02`.\nLoad balancer is **dnsdist** (not HAProxy). VMs use **OneAgent**; Pis use **OTel**.",
        "type": "markdown"
      },
      "12": {
        "davis": {
          "davisVisualization": {
            "isAvailable": true
          },
          "enabled": false
        },
        "query": "fetch logs, from: now()-24h\n| filter contains(content, \"dnsdist\") and contains(content, \"Timeout\")\n| filter host.name == \"nslb.lindleyhome.com\" or host.name == \"nslb-pi\"\n| summarize issues = count(), by:{host.name, content}\n| sort issues desc\n| limit 20",
        "querySettings": {
          "defaultSamplingRatio": 10,
          "defaultScanLimitGbytes": 500,
          "enableSampling": false,
          "maxResultMegaBytes": 100,
          "maxResultRecords": 1000
        },
